{"help": "https://open.canada.ca/data/api/3/action/help_show?name=package_show", "success": true, "result": {"association_type": [], "audience": [], "author": null, "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "collection": "primary", "contributor": {"fr": "", "en": ""}, "creator": "", "creator_user_id": "aa584ab4-544c-4c5c-81da-d1cff9bd96fa", "data_series_issue_identification": {"fr": "", "en": ""}, "data_series_name": {"fr": "", "en": ""}, "date_published": "2015-12-18 00:00:00", "digital_object_identifier": "", "display_flags": [], "frequency": "P3M", "geographic_region": [], "id": "d8f85d91-7dec-4fd1-8055-483b77225d8b", "imso_approval": "true", "isopen": false, "jurisdiction": "federal", "keywords": {"fr": ["Divulgation proactive", "contracts du gouvernement", "achatsetvente"], "en": ["Proactive Disclosure", "PD", "Government Contracts", "buyandsell"]}, "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "license_title": "Open Government Licence - Canada", "license_url": "https://open.canada.ca/en/open-government-licence-canada", "maintainer": null, "metadata_created": "2016-09-25T14:06:36.757889", "metadata_modified": "2026-10-03T14:30:02.249852", "name": "d8f85d91-7dec-4fd1-8055-483b77225d8b", "notes": "This dataset consolidates all the proactive publication of contract reports submitted by federal government entities.\r\n\r\nNote: The information contained in these Contracts reports have been derived from data provided by the authorized federal reporting entities. As the data is unaudited, no warranty or other legal assurance as to the accuracy or completeness of this information is stated or can be implied. Any person making use of this information for any purpose does so at his or her own risk, and the Government of Canada shall have no liability. For information regarding the specifics of the contract data provided in these Contract reports, please contact the authorized federal reporting entity identified in the contract data.", "notes_translated": {"fr": "Cet ensemble de donn\u00e9es consolide toutes les publications proactives des rapports de contrats pr\u00e9sent\u00e9s par les entit\u00e9s du gouvernement f\u00e9d\u00e9ral.\r\n\r\nRemarque : Les renseignements contenus dans ces rapports sur la divulgation des contrats sont tir\u00e9s des donn\u00e9es fournies par les entit\u00e9s f\u00e9d\u00e9rales comp\u00e9tentes. Les donn\u00e9es n\u2019\u00e9tant pas v\u00e9rifi\u00e9es, aucune garantie ou autre assurance l\u00e9gale, expresse ou implicite, n\u2019est donn\u00e9e quant \u00e0 l\u2019exactitude ou \u00e0 l\u2019exhaustivit\u00e9 de ces renseignements. Toute personne qui utilise ces renseignements, \u00e0 quelque fin que ce soit, le fait \u00e0 ses propres risques, et le gouvernement du Canada n\u2019assumera aucune responsabilit\u00e9, quelle qu\u2019elle soit. Afin d\u2019obtenir des renseignements concernant les donn\u00e9es sur les contrats pr\u00e9sent\u00e9s dans ces rapports sur la divulgation des contrats, veuillez communiquer avec l\u2019entit\u00e9 d\u00e9clarante f\u00e9d\u00e9rale comp\u00e9tente mentionn\u00e9e dans les donn\u00e9es du contrat.", "en": "This dataset consolidates all the proactive publication of contract reports submitted by federal government entities.\r\n\r\nNote: The information contained in these Contracts reports have been derived from data provided by the authorized federal reporting entities. As the data is unaudited, no warranty or other legal assurance as to the accuracy or completeness of this information is stated or can be implied. Any person making use of this information for any purpose does so at his or her own risk, and the Government of Canada shall have no liability. For information regarding the specifics of the contract data provided in these Contract reports, please contact the authorized federal reporting entity identified in the contract data."}, "num_resources": 11, "num_tags": 0, "org_section": {"fr": "", "en": ""}, "org_title_at_publication": {"fr": "Secr\u00e9tariat du Conseil 